hadiths[41]{hadithnumber,text}:
"287","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"288","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Said ibn al- Musayyab from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"289","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'zZinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"290","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'n-Nadr"
"291","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abd ar-Rahman ibn Harmala al- Aslami from Said ibn al-Musayyab that the Messenger of Allah"
"292","Yahya related to me from Malik from Sumayy"
"293","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Abu Bakr ibn Sulayman ibn Abi Hathma that Umar ibn al-Khattab missed Sulayman ibn Abi Hathma in the subh prayer. In the morning he went to the market"
"294","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Muhammad ibn Ibrahim that Abd ar-Rahman ibn Abi Amra al-Ansari said that Uthman ibn Affan came to the isha prayer and seeing only a few people in the mosque"
"295","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from a man of the Bani'd-Dil called Busr ibn Mihjan from his father Mihjan that he was in a gathering with the Messenger of Allah"
"296","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that a man asked Abdullah ibn Umar"
"297","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that a man asked Said ibn al-Musayyab"
"298","Yahya related to me from Malik from Afif as-Sahmi that a man from the tribe of Bani Asad asked Abu Ayyub al-Ansari. ""Sometimes I pray in my house"
"299","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar used to say"
"300","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"301","Yahya related to me from Malik that Nafi said"
"302","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that a man used to lead the people in prayer in al-Aqiq (a place near Madina)"
"303","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Anas ibn Malik that the Messenger of Allah"
"304","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that A'isha"
"305","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that the Messenger of Allah"
"306","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ismail ibn Muhammad ibn Said ibn Abi Waqqas from a mawla of Amr ibn al-As or of Abdullah ibn Amr ibn al-As that the Messenger of Allah"
"307","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Abdullah ibn Amr ibn al As said"
"308","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from as-Sa'ib ibn Yazid from al Muttalib ibn Abi Wadaa as-Sahmi that Hafsa"
"309","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that A'isha"
"310","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Yazid al-Madani and from Abu'n Nadr from Abu Salama ibn Abd ar-Rahman from A'isha"
"311","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Urwa ibn az-Zubayr and Said ibn al-Musayyab used to pray voluntary prayers sitting"
"312","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from al-Qaqa ibn Hakim that Abu Yunus"
"313","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam that Amr ibn Rafi said"
"314","Yahya related to me from Malik from Da'ud ibn al-Husayn that Ibn Yarbu al-Makhzumi said"
"315","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that AIi ibn Abi Talib and Abdullah ibn Abbas used to say"
"316","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that Umar ibn Abi Salama saw the Messenger of Allah"
"317","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Said ibn al- Musayyab from Abu Hurayra that some one asked the Messenger of Allah"
"318","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Said ibn al- Musayyab said that Abu Hurayra was asked"
"319","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Jabir ibn Abdullah used to pray in one garment"
"320","Yahya related to me from Malik from Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman that Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm used to pray in a single long shirt"
"321","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard from Jabir ibn Abdullah that the Messenger of Allah"
"322","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that A'isha"
"323","Yahya related to me from Malik from Muhammad ibn Zayd ibn Qunfudh that his mother asked Umm Salama"
"324","Yahya related to me from Malik from a reliable source from Bukayr ibn Abdullah ibn al-Ashajj from Busr ibn Said that when Ubaydullah ibn al-Aswad al-Khawlani was in the room of Maimuna"
"325","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that a woman asked him for a decision"
"326","Yahya related to me from Malik from Da'ud ibn al-Husayn from al- Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"327","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zubayr al-Makki from Abu't-Tufayl Amir ibn Wathila that Muadh ibn Jabal told him that they went out with the Messenger of Allah"